    "whatItIs": "Zyte (formerly Scrapinghub) is a managed web-data collection platform — Zyte API for crawling/extraction rather than a raw residential-proxy GB pack as the primary shape. Pay-as-you-go plus monthly commitments from $100. $5 free trial credit. Same web-data-collection cluster as Bright Data. Bright Data remains the award (7.7); this entity does not outrank it. Distinct from IPRoyal’s $1.75/GB residential floor and from Apify’s Actor compute path.",
